<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13158] Get rid of Externalizable interface at IgniteTxAdapter</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13158</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;It seems that &lt;tt&gt;IgniteTxAdapter&lt;/tt&gt; implements &lt;tt&gt;Externalizable&lt;/tt&gt; without any reason. Transaction instances are not transferred via network, and so I see no reason for implementing &lt;tt&gt;Externalizable&lt;/tt&gt; interface.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
